services=[('website-development','Website design & development','A website that makes your next step clear.','Your website should explain your offer, earn trust, and make enquiries easy. A beautiful layout is only useful when it helps your visitors act.',['Page structure and content guidance','Custom responsive design','Accessible development and integrations','Technical SEO foundations','Testing, launch and editable handover']),('design','Branding & graphic design','Bring your business into focus.','When your visuals feel inconsistent, your offer becomes harder to recognise. Build a practical visual system you can use every day.',['Brand discovery and visual direction','Logo and identity system','Colour and typography guidance','Marketing and social templates','Editable files and usage guidance']),('seo-marketing','SEO & digital marketing','Make it easier for the right people to find you.','Search and marketing work best when they connect a clear offer with useful content and an easy next step. Start with the foundations, then measure what matters.',['Technical and on-page SEO review','Keyword and content planning','Analytics configuration with agreed consent','Campaign strategy and landing pages','Reporting with verified data and next steps'])]
