for slug,name,desc,k,tag in projects:
 pages[f'/work/{slug}/']=(name+' — concept case study',intro('CONCEPT CASE STUDY / DEMONSTRATION',name,desc)+'<section>'+mock(k)+'</section><section class="reading"><h2>Context</h2><p>An original fictional '+('lifestyle store' if k=='olive' else 'architecture practice')+' brief, created to demonstrate visual design and website structure. No client commissioned this work.</p><h2>My role</h2><p>Concept direction, visual identity exploration, interface design, and responsive implementation.</p><h2>Design decisions</h2><p>'+('Earthy colours and sculptural product forms give the collection a quiet, tactile feel. A short headline and clear navigation keep the offer readable.' if k=='olive' else 'Architectural shapes, generous space, and a contrasting palette create a clear hierarchy for a project-led practice.')+'</p><h2>Finished exploration & limitations</h2><p>This visual concept is included in the studio website. It is not a deployed shop or client website. There are no live transactions, user studies, analytics, or verified business results.</p><a class="textlink" href="/work/">← Back to work</a></section>'+contact())
pages['/privacy/']=('Privacy information',intro('PRIVACY','A simple site.<br>Clear information.','Last updated: 14 October 2026.')+'<section class="reading"><h2>Enquiries</h2><p>The form prepares a mailto draft in your email application. This site does not submit, store, or retain your form entries. If you send the email, your name, email address, and message are received by Kumar Saurabh Mishra at contactkumarsmishra@gmail.com and processed by the relevant email providers.</p><h2>Purpose and retention</h2><p>Enquiry information is used to respond and discuss your project. No automated marketing subscription is created. A formal retention schedule and registered business address are [to be confirmed before public launch]. Contact Kumar to request access, correction, or deletion of enquiry information.</p><h2>Hosting and external services</h2><p>The site is hosted with Sites infrastructure. The hosting provider may process technical request information for delivery and security. Google Fonts is used for typography; your browser contacts Google to load font files. No analytics, advertising trackers, or optional cookies are implemented by this site. Hosting access controls may use their own essential authentication mechanisms.</p><h2>Contact</h2><a href="mailto:contactkumarsmishra@gmail.com">contactkumarsmishra@gmail.com</a></section>')
